---
// TEMPLATE — have the founder (and ideally a professional) review before launch. See docs/business/launch-checklist.md.
import { site } from '@/config/site';
import LegalLayout from '@/layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
---

<LegalLayout title="Terms of sale" updated="November 4, 2026">
  <p>
    These terms apply to purchases from {site.legalName}, based in {site.location}. By placing an order you
    agree to them.
  </p>
  <h2>Products</h2>
  <p>
    Our bags contain activated bamboo charcoal for odor and moisture absorption. They are not a children’s
    toy, not intended for ages under 14, and not a medical, air-purifying, or antibacterial device. Keep away
    from small children and pets. Do not open, eat, or burn the contents. Colors of hand-made canvas vary
    slightly between batches.
  </p>
  <h2>Prices and payment</h2>
  <p>
    Prices are in US dollars and are charged in full at checkout through Stripe, including Founder’s
    Pre-Orders. Bulk pricing is applied automatically based on the number of bags in your cart. We may correct
    obvious pricing errors and will refund you if we cancel an order for that reason.
  </p>
  <h2>Founder’s Pre-Orders</h2>
  <p>
    Pre-order items show a ship-by date before you buy and in your confirmation. If we cannot ship by that
    date, we will notify you with a revised date and give you the choice to cancel for a full refund. If no
    date is stated, we ship within 30 days. You can cancel a pre-order for a full refund at any time before it
    ships.
  </p>
  <h2>Shipping, returns, and refunds</h2>
  <p>
    See our <a href="/legal/shipping-returns">shipping &amp; returns policy</a>.
  </p>
  <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
  <p>
    To the fullest extent permitted by law, our liability for any claim relating to a product is limited to
    the amount you paid for it.
  </p>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Questions about these terms:{' '}
    <a href={`mailto:${site.contact.supportEmail}`}>{site.contact.supportEmail}</a>.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
